MIID_H_SuperWhiteMagicBook: Use to greatly increase white-magic skill.
MIID_Agnea: Agnea Tome
MIID_H_Agnea: Use to learn Agnea's Arrow, the ultimate\nfire magic that reduces everything it\ntouches to ash.
MIID_Fimbul: Fimbulvetr Tome
MIID_H_Fimbul: Use to learn Fimbulvetr Night, the ultimate\nice magic with the power to summon an\neternal winter.
MIID_ArchiveSlime: Archive Β
MIID_H_ArchiveSlime: Use to learn Mire B, a common long-ranged\nspell among practitioners of dark magic.
MIID_ArchiveDeath: Archive Γ
MIID_H_ArchiveDeath: Use to learn Death Γ, devastating dark\nmagic that boasts a high Crit.
MIID_ArchiveWarm: Archive Ζ
MIID_H_ArchiveWarm: Use to learn Swarm Ζ, dark magic that\ndrains a foe of Spd when it hits.
MIID_ArchiveBanshee: Archive Θ
MIID_H_ArchiveBanshee: Use to learn Banshee Θ, dark magic that\ninflicts Immobilize on a foe when it hits.
MIID_ArchiveDarkSpikes: Archive Τ
MIID_H_ArchiveDarkSpikes: Use to learn Dark Spikes T, dark magic with\ntremendous efficacy against cavalry.
