MIID_SharpClaw: Barb
MIID_H_SharpClaw: An attack using sharp claws or a tail.
MIID_BeastFang: Fang
MIID_H_BeastFang: An attack with sharp fangs.
MIID_BigClub: Great Club
MIID_H_BigClub: An attack with a giant club.
MIID_Blade: Twin Blades
MIID_H_Blade: Slashing attacks with a sword in each hand.
MIID_GiantAxe: Merciful Axe
MIID_H_GiantAxe: An attack swinging a giant axe.
MIID_SharpBeak: Great Beak
MIID_H_SharpBeak: An attack with a giant beak.
MIID_ShadowPunch: Shadeclaw
MIID_H_ShadowPunch: A frenzied claw attack.
MIID_BalorAttack: Abyssal Claw
MIID_H_BalorAttack: An attack with massive dragon claws.\nCan hit all foes within attack range\nsimultaneously.
MIID_BalorCounter: Darkest Roar
MIID_H_BalorCounter: A magic attack. After foe attacks, unit's\ncounter stops combat and attacks target\nand all adjacent foes.
MIID_ChargeAttack: Headbutt
MIID_H_ChargeAttack: An attack that smashes foes with the\ncreature's powerful head.
MIID_BigNeedle: Great Stinger
MIID_H_BigNeedle: An attack from the creature's stinger.
MIID_BeastClaw: Beast Claw
MIID_H_BeastClaw: A ferocious claw swipe.
MIID_WaterMagic: Water Strike
MIID_H_WaterMagic: An attack with an intense water current.
MIID_BigSharpClaw: Great Claw
MIID_H_BigSharpClaw: An attack with a giant claw.
MIID_BigSweep: Mandibles
MIID_H_BigSweep: A powerful attack using sharp jaws.
MIID_BigBlade: Giant Sword
MIID_H_BigBlade: A powerful slash attack with a giant sword.
MIID_CetusFang: Sea Tyrant's Fang
MIID_H_CetusFang: A devastating attack from massive dragon\nfangs.
MIID_Dissolution: Acid Spray
MIID_H_Dissolution: An attack that sprays a dissolving solution.
MIID_RapidDissolution: Acid Spray
MIID_H_RapidDissolution: An attack that rapidly sprays a dissolving\nsolution.
MIID_BigWing: Great Wing
MIID_H_BigWing: An attack with massive wings that creates\na typhoon of air.
MIID_DagdaClaw: Dagda's Claw
MIID_H_DagdaClaw: An attack with a dragon's massive claws.
MIID_MarsClaw: Bringer's Claw
MIID_H_MarsClaw: An attack with a dragon's massive claws.
MIID_NomvedBreath: Crafter's Breath
MIID_H_NomvedBreath: A bellowing magic wave of dragon's breath.
MIID_LyrahBreath: Earth's Breath
MIID_H_LyrahBreath: A bellowing magic wave of dragon's breath.
MIID_EishetBreath: Water's Breath
MIID_H_EishetBreath: A bellowing magic wave of dragon's breath.
MIID_SetethHorn: Hammering Horn
MIID_H_SetethHorn: An attack with a horn growing from the\ndragon's hammerhead.
MIID_DarkSharpClaw: Claw
MIID_H_DarkSharpClaw: A clawing attack from a Demonic Beast\nof the underworld.
MIID_DeathClaw: Claw of the Dead
MIID_H_DeathClaw: An attack with claws surging with the\nunderworld's power.
MIID_DeathFang: Death Dragon's Fang
MIID_H_DeathFang: An attack from the fangs of a death dragon.
MIID_BowTurret: Ballista
MIID_H_BowTurret: A device that fires massive arrows.\nCan be used to attack distant foes.
MIID_MagicTurret: Fire Orb
MIID_H_MagicTurret: A device that radiates fire magic.\nCan be used to attack distant foes.
MIID_Catapult: Onager
MIID_H_Catapult: A device that hurls massive boulders.\nCan be used to attack distant foes.
MIID_NoseAttack: Trunk Attack
MIID_H_NoseAttack: An attack that uses the animal's powerful\ntrunk to strike foes.
MIID_Stomping: Trample
MIID_H_Stomping: An attack that uses the animal's body\nweight to trample foes.
MIID_AuroraJuwel: Red Jewel
MIID_H_AuroraJuwel: A keepsake of Cai's mother, stolen by\nthieves who attacked his home.
MIID_RedGem: Red Jewel
MIID_H_RedGem: The gem embedded in Cai's left hand,\nsurging with the power of black flames.\nGrants Mag{Variable=0}.
MIID_D_RedGem: Dark Red Jewel
MIID_H_D_RedGem: The cursed gem in Cai's left hand. Its flames\nyearn to consume until everything is ash.\nGrants Mag{Variable=0}.
MIID_BlackGwen: Ink-Black Wen
MIID_H_BlackGwen: A cloak blacker than darkness itself.\nIt allows the wearer to stride between\nshadows. Grants Dex{Variable=0}.
MIID_D_BlackGwen: Ink-Dark Wen
MIID_H_D_BlackGwen: Dietrich's cloak. It hungers to envelop all in\nthe demon god's shadow. Grants Dex{Variable=0}.
MIID_MahamadouHand: Mahadu's Right Arm
MIID_H_MahamadouHand: An arm of the legendary Mahadu, now\nfused to a new hero, Theodora of Saramis.\nGrants Str{Variable=0}.
MIID_D_MahamadouHand: Mahadu's Dark Arm
MIID_H_D_MahamadouHand: Once a tool for good, Theodora's arm now\nuses its dark power to maim and destroy.\nGrants Str{Variable=0}.
MIID_BlackSun: Obsidian
MIID_H_BlackSun: A legendary vihuela with the power to\nshake the very earth with its notes.\nGrants Res{Variable=0}.
MIID_D_BlackSun: Dark Obsidian
MIID_H_D_BlackSun: Leda's vihuela. With every note, horrid\nmelodies echo from the blackness.\nGrants Res{Variable=0}.
MIID_H_D_BlackSun_Cohen: Obsidian, stained even darker than usual.\nIt reverberates with the power of the\nunderworld. Grants Res{Variable=0}.
MIID_RedAxeCurse: Bloodaxe Curse
MIID_H_RedAxeCurse: The Arago royal-family Bloodaxe, said to\nbestow divine protection upon its wielder.\nGrants Str{Variable=0}.
MIID_BloodPattern: Blood Pattern
MIID_H_BloodPattern: The markings on Bertrand's body that set\nhis blood ablaze. Grants Str{Variable=0}.
MIID_D_BloodPattern: Dark Blood Pattern
MIID_H_D_BloodPattern: Infernal markings on Bertrand's body that\nfill his veins with the vile power of\ndarkness. Grants Str{Variable=0}.
MIID_DhabaCompass: Dhaba's Compass
MIID_H_DhabaCompass: Talimun's legendary compass that guides\nits owner to their greatest desires.\nGrants Mag{Variable=0}.
MIID_D_DhabaCompass: Dhaba's Dark Compass
MIID_H_D_DhabaCompass: Once a priceless tool of adventure, this\ncompass will curse anyone who defies\nits master. Grants Mag{Variable=0}.
MIID_SecretBody: Mysterious Form
MIID_H_SecretBody: The secret of Orchel's body. The truth is\nveiled in mystery. Grants Def{Variable=0}.
MIID_MechanicalBody: Mechanical Form
MIID_H_MechanicalBody: The key to Orchel's incredible strength,\nthe power of guardian angel Elizabeth.\nGrants Def{Variable=0}.
MIID_SevenStartsCore: Seven-Star Engine
MIID_H_SevenStartsCore: A unique internal mechanism that gives\nAnatolia her incredible physical abilities.\nGrants Dex{Variable=0}.
MIID_D_SevenStartsCore: Dark-Star Engine
MIID_H_D_SevenStartsCore: The secret to Anatolia's strength, tainted\nbeyond saving. This rot will destroy her.\nGrants Dex{Variable=0}.
MIID_CaptainCore: Leader's Heart Core
MIID_H_CaptainCore: The final Heart Core, entrusted to a savior.\nIt is the power to bring light to the world.\nGrants Dex{Variable=0}.
MIID_RecklessTreasure: Magic Orb
MIID_H_RecklessTreasure: The object that will decide today's winner.\nReduces Def of unit carrying it to 0.
MIID_ResonateStone: Magic Echo Shard
MIID_H_ResonateStone: A required material for combat-arts\nenhancement.
MIID_ResonateStoneL: Magic Echo Rock
MIID_H_ResonateStoneL: Magic Echo Shards×{Variable=0}.
MIID_ResonateStoneS: Magic Echo Stone
MIID_H_ResonateStoneS: Magic Echo Shards×{Variable=0}.
MIID_AmaltheaMap: Amalthea Map
MIID_H_AmaltheaMap: A map noting major locations in Amalthea,\nthe empire's central region containing\nDagsion.
MIID_LambuthMap: Lambath Map
MIID_H_LambuthMap: A map noting major locations in Lambath,\nthe region west of the capital.
MIID_ElectraMap: Elektra Map
MIID_H_ElectraMap: A map noting major locations in Elektra,\nthe bustling region to the southeast of\nthe capital.
MIID_CastaliaMap: Castalia Map
MIID_H_CastaliaMap: A map noting major locations in Castalia,\nthe vibrant trading region to the northeast\nof the capital.
MIID_TaliaMap: Thaleia Map
MIID_H_TaliaMap: A map noting major locations in Thaleia,\nthe rugged, mountainous region north of\nthe capital.
MIID_SolidusMap: Solidus Map
MIID_H_SolidusMap: A map noting major locations in Solidus,\nfar to the northwest, where people coexist\nwith natural threats.
MIID_BasithaMap: Pasithea Map
MIID_H_BasithaMap: A map noting major locations in Pasithea,\nthe largely uncharted region to the far west\nof Dagsion.
MIID_BraxtheaMap: Braxithea Map
MIID_H_BraxtheaMap: A map noting major locations in Braxithea,\nthe lush forest region far to the southwest\nof the capital.
MIID_MeliasMap: Melias Map
MIID_H_MeliasMap: A map noting major locations in Melias,\nthe region south of Dagsion where gentle\nbreezes flow.
MIID_SaveronMap: Saveilon Map
MIID_H_SaveronMap: A map noting major locations in Saveilon\nto the far south of the capital, known for\nits tragic history.
